lib/
├── angle_utils/      — clipAngleTo360, smallerAngleDifference, angleBisector
│                       No Arduino dependency. Safe to use in native/host tests.
│
├── calibration/      — calibrateLightRing() routine
│                       Reads LDR sensors, prints thresholds to Serial for copy-paste
│                       into LDR_THRESHOLDS in config.h. Layer 1 only.
│
├── cam_comm/         — Camera → Layer 2 serial link (Serial3)
│                       Parses CSV frames from the MaixCam (goals + ball).
│                       Owns camBlueDetected/X/Y/Dist/Angle, camYellowDetected/...,
│                       camBallDetected/X/Y/Dist/Angle state.
│                       Layer 2 only.
│
├── layer1_comm/      — Layer 1 → Layer 2 serial link (Serial4)
│                       readL1(), setupL1Comm(), debugL1Readings()
│                       Owns l1LineDetected, l1Angle, l1Size state.
│                       Packet framing via serial_comm.
│
├── layer3_comm/      — Layer 3 → Layer 2 serial link (Serial5)
│                       readL3(), setupL3Comm(), debugL3Readings()
│                       Owns l3BallDetected, l3BallAngle, l3BallCount,
│                       l3SwitchGoal/Role/Strat0/Strat1 state.
│                       Packet framing via serial_comm.
│
├── light_ring/       — 32-sensor LDR ring (MUX channel select, ADC reads, findLine())
│                       Pin definitions in light_ring.h.
│                       Thresholds sourced from include/config.h.
│                       Depends on angle_utils.
│
├── movement/         — X-drive motor control and IMU-assisted heading hold
│                       setupMotors(), setupIMU(), readIMU(), moveRobot()
│                       resetYawTarget(), setMotor(), debugIMU()
│                       Owns imuYaw, imuAccelX/Y/Z state.
│                       Tuning constants sourced from include/config.h.
│
├── scoring/          — Dribbler ESC, kicker solenoid, lightgate
│                       setupESC(), setupSol(), setupLightgate()
│                       Owns dribbler (Servo) and isActuated state.
│
└── serial_comm/      — Shared UART packet framing (SerialComm class)
                        Format: [0xAA] [len] [data_hi] [data_lo] ... [checksum]
                        Values are int16_t, transmitted big-endian.
                        Used by layer1_comm, layer3_comm, and any future inter-layer links.

Libraries are auto-discovered and compiled by PlatformIO for whichever
environment includes them.
